{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261124%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E9%87%8D%E9%BB%9E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E9%80%9F%E8%A6%BD_01-1-1024x1024.png\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>🔸高等法院<br/>► 1000　10庭　暫委法官祁彥輝<br/>蔡天鳳案　前夫、家翁及大伯否認謀殺罪｜續審<br/>► 1430　25庭　聆案官葉樹培<br/>MIRROR演唱會事故　受傷舞蹈員李啟言分入稟向康文署長、僱主「舞館」及舞台工程總承辦商等索償｜核對列表審核聆訊<br/>► 0930　28庭　法官高浩文<br/>新田科技城環評司法覆核　高院准社工謝世傑撤回申請｜宣布訟費決定</p>\n<p>🔸區域法院<br/>► 1000　25庭　暫委法官鄧少雄<br/>興達大廈大維修圍標案｜續審<br/>► 1145　26庭　法官高勁修<br/>19歲男生涉管有偽造廉署委任證｜再提訊</p>\n<p>🔸沙田法院<br/>► 0930　6庭　裁判官陳志輝<br/>六旬男子涉城巴上以飛機杯搖晃下體｜開審<br/>► 0930　7庭　裁判官黃國輝<br/>22歲男生涉威脅發布女子私密影像　再涉襲擊事主及要脅對方銷案｜續審</p>\n<hr/>\n<p>「重點法庭案件速覽」是根據法庭日誌內，我們認為大眾會關注的翌日案件，選取出來以方便讀者閱覽</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n<p></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T13:55:15.890345+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":417,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T13:27:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T18:16:56.909194+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T13:48:37.744591+00:00","content_hash":"33cc051b6b8cceaaa35c281e06e1df8196fb6f57192254aec03f1f1334d6b9af","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}